{"sha": "6b84407270892b4778e980b9e9149161e3c8e7d9f802666e6aca2be6d16da67b", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:7}", "设 $\\gamma$ 为 $S$ 上画出的一条曲线，令 $g(t) = \\norm{\\gamma(t)", "- \\Omega}^2$，则 $g'(t) = 2\\langle \\gamma'(t),\\ \\gamma(t) -", "\\Omega\\rangle$。过 $M = \\gamma(t)$ 的法线经过", "$\\Omega$（由假设），故 $\\gamma(t) - \\Omega$ 是一个\\emph{法向量}，", "与切平面正交，特别地与", "速度 $\\gamma'(t)$（见\\cref{prop:b2:surfaces:velocity}）：$g' =", "0$，从而 $g$ 沿每条画出的曲线为常数。", "", "考虑集合 $S_c = \\{M \\in S : \\norm{M - \\Omega}^2 = c\\}$，", "它是 $S$ 中的闭集；它也是 $S$ 中的开集：在其任一点附近，$S$", "是一个正则函数图像，故 $S$ 中任一邻近点都可", "用一条画出的曲线（一段提升的线段）与之相连，沿该曲线 $g$ 为常数。由于", "$S$ 连通，$S_c$ 在 $c$ 取适当值时非空，故 $S = S_c", "\\subseteq$ 以 $\\Omega$ 为球心、$\\sqrt c$ 为半径的球面", "（见\\cref{ch:b2:metric}：连通性论证）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:8}", "记 $\\Phi(u', v') = (u, v)$。由链式法则，", "\\[", "\\tilde\\sigma_{u'} = \\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial u'}\\sigma_u", "+ \\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial u'}\\sigma_v,", "\\qquad", "\\tilde\\sigma_{v'} = \\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial v'}\\sigma_u", "+ \\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial v'}\\sigma_v ,", "\\]", "其中 $\\sigma$ 的偏导数均在 $\\Phi(u',v')$ 处取值。将", "向量积双线性展开，并利用 $\\sigma_u \\wedge \\sigma_u =", "\\sigma_v \\wedge \\sigma_v = 0$，$\\sigma_v \\wedge \\sigma_u =", "-\\sigma_u \\wedge \\sigma_v$：", "\\[", "\\tilde\\sigma_{u'} \\wedge \\tilde\\sigma_{v'}", "= \\Bigl(\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial u'}", "\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial v'}", "- \\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial u'}", "\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial v'}\\Bigr)\\,", "\\sigma_u \\wedge \\sigma_v", "= \\det J_\\Phi \\cdot (\\sigma_u \\wedge \\sigma_v)\\circ\\Phi .", "\\]", "取模即得恒等式。再由", "\\cref{ch:b2:multint}中的变量替换公式，对映射 $\\Phi$ 在 $K' =", "\\Phi^{-1}(K)$ 上应用，得：", "\\[", "\\iint_{K'} \\norm{\\tilde\\sigma_{u'} \\wedge \\tilde\\sigma_{v'}}", "\\,\\dd u'\\dd v'", "= \\iint_{K'} \\norm{\\sigma_u \\wedge \\sigma_v}\\circ\\Phi\\;", "\\abs{\\det J_\\Phi}\\,\\dd u'\\dd v'", "= \\iint_K \\norm{\\sigma_u \\wedge \\sigma_v}\\,\\dd u\\,\\dd v :", "\\]", "两种参数化对同一块", "曲面片给出相同的面积。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:9}", "在球坐标卡中，$z = R\\sin\\varphi$，球带", "对应于 $\\varphi_1 \\leq \\varphi \\leq \\varphi_2$，其中", "$z_i = R\\sin\\varphi_i$。取面积元", "$R^2\\cos\\varphi\\,\\dd\\theta\\,\\dd\\varphi$", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:surfaces:spherearea}）：", "\\[", "\\mathcal A = \\int_{\\varphi_1}^{\\varphi_2}\\!\\!\\int_0^{2\\pi}", "R^2\\cos\\varphi\\,\\dd\\theta\\,\\dd\\varphi", "= 2\\pi R^2(\\sin\\varphi_2 - \\sin\\varphi_1)", "= 2\\pi R\\,(z_2 - z_1) .", "\\]", "结果仅依赖于高度 $z_2 - z_1$：等厚的", "切片面积相等，无论切在赤道", "或切在极点处 --- 阿基米德帽盒定理，也正是", "外切圆柱的侧面积（$2\\pi R \\cdot", "2R = 4\\pi R^2$）与球面面积相等的原因。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:10}", "$\\sigma_\\theta = (-r\\sin\\theta,\\ r\\cos\\theta,\\ 0)$，且", "$\\sigma_z = (r'\\cos\\theta,\\ r'\\sin\\theta,\\ 1)$，于是", "\\[", "\\sigma_\\theta \\wedge \\sigma_z", "= (r\\cos\\theta,\\ r\\sin\\theta,\\ -r\\,r') ,", "\\]", "这是点 $M = (r\\cos\\theta, r\\sin\\theta, z)$ 处的法向量。过该点的", "法线为", "\\[", "t \\mapsto \\bigl(r(1 + t)\\cos\\theta,\\ r(1 + t)\\sin\\theta,\\", "z - t\\,r\\,r'\\bigr),", "\\]", "当 $t = -1$ 时到达 $(0,\\ 0,\\ z + r(z)\\,r'(z))$：每条", "法线都与轴相交，交点高度为 $z + rr'$。（这", "是三维空间中旋转对称性在法向场里仍然保持的", "原因。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:11}", "$\\sigma_u = (-\\sin u, \\cos u, 0)$，$\\sigma_v = (0, 0, 1)$：$E", "= 1$，$F = 0$，$G = 1$。由", "\\cref{prop:b2:surfaces:curvelength}，画出曲线的长度为", "$\\int\\sqrt{u'^2 + v'^2}\\,\\dd t$ --- 即其参数影子", "$(u(t), v(t))$ 在平面中的长度：该坐标卡是", "局部等距映射（圆柱的展开）。螺线", "$t \\mapsto (\\cos t, \\sin t, ct)$，$t \\in \\intcc0{2\\pi}$，其", "影子为从 $(0,0)$ 到 $(2\\pi, 2\\pi c)$ 的线段，长度为", "$2\\pi\\sqrt{1 + c^2}$。任一条由 $(1,0,0)$ 到 $(1,", "0, 2\\pi c)$ 绕一整圈的画出曲线，其影子连续", "地连接 $(0, 0)$ 与 $(2\\pi, 2\\pi c)$，平面长度 $\\geq$", "直线段的长度；由于长度相等，螺线", "最短。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:surfaces:12}", "函数 $g(M) = \\norm{M}^2$ 在紧的", "$S$ 上连续，故在某点 $M_0$ 取得最大值。", "对每条曲线 $\\gamma$（画在 $S$ 上，且 $\\gamma(0) = M_0$），函数 $t", "\\mapsto \\norm{\\gamma(t)}^2$ 在 $t = 0$ 处取极大值，故其", "导数 $2\\langle\\gamma'(0), M_0\\rangle$ 为零，故 $M_0$", "与每个切向量正交，亦即 $S$ 在", "$M_0$ 处的法向。由于 $\\nabla f(M_0) \\neq 0$ 也给出法线方向", "（见\\cref{prop:b2:surfaces:gradient}），$\\nabla f(M_0)$ 与", "$\\vect{OM_0}$ 共线。对椭球面，", "径向性意味着", "\\[", "\\Bigl(\\frac{x_0}{a^2}, \\frac{y_0}{b^2},", "\\frac{z_0}{c^2}\\Bigr) = \\mu\\,(x_0, y_0, z_0) :", "\\]", "各坐标满足 $x_0(\\frac1{a^2} - \\mu) = 0$ 等；", "由于 $a^{-2}, b^{-2}, c^{-2}$ 互不相同，至多", "一个坐标非零，且曲面上的解为", "六个轴端点 $(\\pm a, 0, 0)$、$(0, \\pm b, 0)$、$(0,", "0, \\pm c)$。最远的点是 $(\\pm a, 0, 0)$，它们", "距原点的距离为 $a = \\max(a,b,c)$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}